stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> DefaultConversation: started [onlineCount < 10]
    [*] --> Interacting: started [onlineCount >= 10]

    state "Default Conversation" as DefaultConversation
    state "Interacting" as Interacting
    state "Waiting" as Waiting
    state "Recording" as Recording
    state "Questioning" as Questioning
    state "Thanks For Joining" as ThanksForJoining

    DefaultConversation: entry / resetReplyCycle(good to hear)
    DefaultConversation: new message / replyCycle(good to hear, thank you, How are you)
    DefaultConversation: new post / comment(Nice post, author)

    Interacting: entry / resetReplyCycle(Hi hi😁)
    Interacting: new message / replyCycle(Hi hi😁, I like your idea!)
    Interacting: new post / comment(How do you guys think about it?, bot -> loginOrder)

    Waiting: entry / recorder retained
    Recording: speak / record(voiceMessage)

    ThanksForJoining: entry / announceResult(broadcast if no speaker, otherwise chat)

    DefaultConversation --> Interacting: login [onlineCount >= 10]
    Interacting --> DefaultConversation: logout [onlineCount < 10]

    DefaultConversation --> Waiting: record @bot [quota >= 3 && no speaker] / reply + decreaseQuota(3) + setRecorder(author)
    DefaultConversation --> Recording: record @bot [quota >= 3 && speaker exists] / reply + decreaseQuota(3) + setRecorder(author)
    Interacting --> Waiting: record @bot [quota >= 3 && no speaker] / reply + decreaseQuota(3) + setRecorder(author)
    Interacting --> Recording: record @bot [quota >= 3 && speaker exists] / reply + decreaseQuota(3) + setRecorder(author)

    Waiting --> Recording: go broadcasting
    Recording --> Waiting: stop broadcasting / sendRecordReplay(recorder)

    Waiting --> DefaultConversation: stop-recording @bot [author == recorder && onlineCount < 10]
    Waiting --> Interacting: stop-recording @bot [author == recorder && onlineCount >= 10]
    Recording --> DefaultConversation: stop-recording @bot [author == recorder && onlineCount < 10] / sendRecordReplay(recorder)
    Recording --> Interacting: stop-recording @bot [author == recorder && onlineCount >= 10] / sendRecordReplay(recorder)

    DefaultConversation --> Questioning: king @bot [author.isAdmin && quota >= 5] / reply + decreaseQuota(5) + start + ask(Q0)
    Interacting --> Questioning: king @bot [author.isAdmin && quota >= 5] / reply + decreaseQuota(5) + start + ask(Q0)

    Questioning --> Questioning: correct answer @bot [firstCorrect && question remains] / score(author) + ask(nextQuestion)
    Questioning --> ThanksForJoining: correct answer @bot [firstCorrect && allQuestionsDone] / score(author)
    Questioning --> ThanksForJoining: 1 hour elapsed

    Questioning --> Questioning: play again @bot [quota >= 5] / decreaseQuota(5) + startAgain + ask(Q0)
    ThanksForJoining --> Questioning: play again @bot [quota >= 5] / decreaseQuota(5) + startAgain + ask(Q0)

    Questioning --> DefaultConversation: king-stop @bot [author.isAdmin && onlineCount < 10]
    Questioning --> Interacting: king-stop @bot [author.isAdmin && onlineCount >= 10]
    ThanksForJoining --> DefaultConversation: king-stop @bot [author.isAdmin && onlineCount < 10]
    ThanksForJoining --> Interacting: king-stop @bot [author.isAdmin && onlineCount >= 10]

    ThanksForJoining --> DefaultConversation: 20 seconds elapsed [onlineCount < 10]
    ThanksForJoining --> Interacting: 20 seconds elapsed [onlineCount >= 10]
